      "description": "Sponsored by Team Possible. Mondays at 19:30 UTC. Entry: 50 DEC. Modern Silver Ghost Card Event. One one-hour round, groups of up to eight and a maximum of seven matches per player. Four registered players are required.\n\nWeekly prizes, all 13 weeks: 1st\u2014Escalation Pack + 962 DEC; 2nd\u2014Foundation Pack + 481 DEC; 3rd\u2014288 DEC; 4th\u2014192 DEC.\n\nAfter 13 weeks, the Top 8 share 45,000 DEC: 18,000 / 9,000 / 5,400 / 3,375 / 2,813 / 2,475 / 2,250 / 1,687 DEC.\n\nJoin Team Possible's Sunday chats, alternating weekly between 2pm and 10pm Eastern. Team Possible Discord: https://discord.gg/SaKc6X8PZb\n\nOne account per person. Cancelled events are refunded and award no points. prizes and standings are reconciled within 48 hours. Splinterlands Support handles match or platform disputes; use the Phoenix Reborn Discord for other disputes. Discord: https://discord.gg/qfFEJkcZ4Z\n",
